[626,6,0,1910,"Poppies in a Meadow","Sergey Prokudin-Gorsky took three black-and-white pictures of the same scene through red, green and blue filters, and combined them into a color image. This field of poppies is one of his early color experiments.","How do the three filters help show true colors?"],
